# CLIo logo - LED board
# The classic 5x7 dot-matrix letters on a framed LED board, unlit
# dots included. Pure symbols: in --ascii the lit dots become O and
# the dark ones dots, so the board survives. 49x9; the small one
# drops the board and the spacing (18x7).
# Animated: the text scrolls in like a marquee (@frame drawings).
@palette
a=#4a4a52
b=#3a2a14
c=#ff9d1a
d=#ffd23f
@effect frames reveal=1
@fps 16
@art
